# NASA shipped this drop with CRLF line endings and every file in the history
# has them. Say "no conversion" explicitly so git's autocrlf -- which is on by
# default on the Windows boxes here and off on macOS -- cannot rewrite them.
#
# It matters in both directions:
#   * demoout/ is the reference output the regression suite diffs our own runs
#     against, so a checkout that flips endings diffs on every line of every
#     file and hides the one line that really moved.
#   * inp/ decks are read by a fixed-form card reader that counts columns.
#
# gfortran reads CRLF fixed-form source without complaint, and on Windows it
# writes CRLF formatted output, so the reference files and our output agree.
* -text
